<title>SPAIN: TABLE-TELEPIZZA H1 NET PROFIT UP 45 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE-TELEPIZZA H1 NET PROFIT UP 45 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for Spanish pizza delivery chain Telepizza for the first half of 1997, compared to same period a year earlier (billions of pesetas, unless stated):</p>
<p> Net profit			    1.03	 vs     0.71</p>
<p> Turnover			     12.75	 up     41.7 pct</p>
<p> Cashflow				1.72	 up     50 pct</p>
<p> Sales				  17.50	 up     37.6 pct</p>
<p>NOTE: Telepizza said the incorporation of Pizza World accounted for roughly 2.4 percent of both profits and sales in the first half.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
